{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: If using keyboard, all UI uses arrow keys, NOT mouse</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Standard Game Mode - Single-Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride your motorcycle along an infinite road, steering around obstacles in your way. Throw bombs at the demon towers along the road to destroy them and gain some time back for Earth's survival. Jump off ramps to leap over roadblocks. Use your shockwave ability to slam into the ground and destroy the next few rows of obstacles in your way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Standard Game Mode - Two-Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op two-player. Player 1 drives, player 2 leans, which helps (or hurts) player 1's ability to steer. Player 1 throws the bombs at the demon towers, player 2 detonates the bomb remotely at the right time to destroy the tower. \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stuntdriver Game Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No demon towers, no bomb throwing, no timer. Be risky, jump off every ramp possible! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the scores you rack up, visit your workshop to unlock new helmets and bike trails!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global and Friend leaderboards available for all 3 game modes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: On some systems, a score will need to be submitted before leaderboards can be initialized.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 16 high-energy original tracks to ride along to!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bomber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636140/d10b50b2b81645d056c77a8537bb245f6651da0e.jpg"},{"name":"Pyromaniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636140/bf2c445625a44e1e1619f163c7bb933ab8bb995e.jpg"},{"name":"Demonic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/